{"id":"525ad20205e63e92","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-trace.md","title":"Trace","display":"df-trace — Trace","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-trace","aliases":["58-df-trace"],"display":"df-trace — Trace","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-trace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-trace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-trace — Trace"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,A,K,n\\in\\mathbf V\">\\(t,A,K,n\\in\\mathbf V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MatrixTrace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MatrixTrace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\\mathrm{MatrixTrace}_S(t,A,K,n)\\leftrightarrow K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land A:n\\times n\\to K\\land t=\\sum_{i\\in n}A(i,i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\\mathrm{MatrixTrace}_S(t,A,K,n)\\leftrightarrow K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land A:n\\times n\\to K\\land t=\\sum_{i\\in n}A(i,i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The unique <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> is denoted <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tr}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{tr}(A)\\)</span>; for a finite-dimensional linear operator it is independent of the chosen basis.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"t,A,K,n\\in\\mathbf V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MatrixTrace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\\mathrm{MatrixTrace}_S(t,A,K,n)\\leftrightarrow K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land A:n\\times n\\to K\\land t=\\sum_{i\\in n}A(i,i)","display":true},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tr}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":603,"backlinks":[{"id":"86302d021525a15b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-trace.md|58-df-trace]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":[]}